@startuml
title PizzaBuilder Lifecycle

[*] --> Configured : new PizzaBuilder() [size=MEDIUM, no toppings]
Configured --> Configured : setSize(size)
Configured --> Configured : addCheese() / addPepperoni() / addMushrooms() / addOlives()
Configured --> Building : build()
Building --> Configured : reset() [defaults restored]
Building --> [*] : Pizza record returned

@enduml
